mbstring: multibyte strings (encodings, conversion, case, regular
expressions with oniguruma of the package az).

The module mbstring of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20230831/mbstring.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d,
its headers in include/php83/php/ext/mbstring.
